      "content": "It is incredibly difficult to feel like the person you once were is gone and that no future exists for the person you are now. While the feeling that \"no one wants to know\" the real you can be overwhelming, please know that your worth is not defined by a job, a name, or even a single failure. If the weight of feeling like a ghost in your own life becomes too heavy to carry, you are encouraged to speak with a crisis counselor at 988.",
