    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy to say \"worth isn't defined by a job\" when you aren't the one sitting in a house that feels like a tomb, watching everyone you ever knew look at you with pity or disgust. there is no \"getting back to normal\" when the normal is gone forever. it feels more like a mercy if it would just stop. if everything would just finally go quiet.",
